/// A motorcycle as a system of components, each part a role played by a kind
/// of thing in that system: the partonomy pattern the partonomy-only view is
/// arranged for. `System` and `Component` stand in for a generic systems
/// ontology, and every part role specializes `Component`.
ontology motorcycle

package motorcycle

category System of functional-complexes
roleMixin Component of functional-complexes

@componenthood relation System [1] <>-- hasProperPart -- [2..*] Component

kind Motorcycle specializes System
kind Engine specializes System
kind Transmission specializes System
kind WheelAssembly specializes System

kind Frame
kind Cylinder
kind Piston
kind Clutch
kind Gearset
kind Rim
kind Tire
kind Hub

role MotorcycleEngine specializes Engine, Component
role MotorcycleTransmission specializes Transmission, Component
role MotorcycleWheel specializes WheelAssembly, Component
role FrontMotorcycleWheel specializes MotorcycleWheel
role RearMotorcycleWheel specializes MotorcycleWheel
role MotorcycleFrame specializes Frame, Component

disjoint complete genset motorcycleWheelPositions where FrontMotorcycleWheel, RearMotorcycleWheel specializes MotorcycleWheel

role EngineCylinder specializes Cylinder, Component
role EnginePiston specializes Piston, Component
role TransmissionClutch specializes Clutch, Component
role TransmissionGearset specializes Gearset, Component
role WheelRim specializes Rim, Component
role WheelTire specializes Tire, Component
role WheelHub specializes Hub, Component

@componenthood relation Motorcycle [1] <>-- hasEngine -- [1] MotorcycleEngine specializes hasProperPart
@componenthood relation Motorcycle [1] <>-- hasTransmission -- [1] MotorcycleTransmission specializes hasProperPart
@componenthood relation Motorcycle [1] <>-- hasWheel -- [2] MotorcycleWheel specializes hasProperPart
@componenthood relation Motorcycle [1] <>-- hasFrontWheel -- [1] FrontMotorcycleWheel specializes hasWheel
@componenthood relation Motorcycle [1] <>-- hasRearWheel -- [1] RearMotorcycleWheel specializes hasWheel
@componenthood relation Motorcycle [1] <>-- hasFrame -- [1] MotorcycleFrame specializes hasProperPart

@componenthood relation MotorcycleEngine [1] <>-- hasCylinder -- [1..*] EngineCylinder specializes hasProperPart
@componenthood relation MotorcycleEngine [1] <>-- hasPiston -- [1..*] EnginePiston specializes hasProperPart
@componenthood relation MotorcycleTransmission [1] <>-- hasClutch -- [1] TransmissionClutch specializes hasProperPart
@componenthood relation MotorcycleTransmission [1] <>-- hasGearset -- [1] TransmissionGearset specializes hasProperPart
@componenthood relation MotorcycleWheel [1] <>-- hasRim -- [1] WheelRim specializes hasProperPart
@componenthood relation MotorcycleWheel [1] <>-- hasTire -- [1] WheelTire specializes hasProperPart
@componenthood relation MotorcycleWheel [1] <>-- hasHub -- [1] WheelHub specializes hasProperPart
